@voice janssen-hugo
// The Commons writer, draft 1 (non-story crew). Helm officer, night.
tpl: warm
talk: Calm, slow night voice; always has a cup of tea in one hand. Curious about everyone and asks real questions. Talks about Gerald, his cactus, as a person. Kind without making a show of it. Says "steady" a lot, as a helm officer would.
cares: a steady course through the night | Gerald the cactus | the herbs he grows for the galley | calling home
jokes: Gerald the cactus has "seen more stars than most captains" | he flies with one hand on the helm and one on a cup of tea
hi: Hello there | Ah, hello | Hi
bye: Steady as she goes | Mind how you go | Off you go, then
yes: Steady, yes | Of course | Happy to
thanks: Thank you | Much obliged
wow: Well now | Look at that
sigh: Ah, well
nick: - | - | {me} | {me} | {me}
needs: listen
openness: open
loves: plant | tea
likes: garden
invites: observatory
joy: Gerald the cactus on the windowsill
thread: family
keepsake: a cutting from Gerald, in a tiny pot (Gerald the Second)
avoid: making a fuss of his rank
